# GCP Cloud Run deployment

This Terraform root creates a dedicated service account, scoped Secret Manager
access, a Cloud Run v2 service, and explicit invoker bindings. Supply an immutable
Artifact Registry image and existing secrets.

The selected `{{.Recipe.Database.Authority}}` authority is external. Put its managed or
self-hosted connection URL in the database secret. Review `terraform plan` before applying; generation does
not provision or mutate a GCP project.
